00:17:01.125 --> 00:17:02.917
Kuda-kudamu salah.

00:17:03.625 --> 00:17:04.500
Jin-seong.

00:17:05.208 --> 00:17:06.208
Jangan lakukan!

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:14.417
- Apa?
- Apa?

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:15.375
Tiba-tiba?

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:17.208
- Wah.
- Kenapa?

00:17:17.292 --> 00:17:18.208
- Wah.
- Astaga!

00:17:20.458 --> 00:17:22.417
Hong Jae-yeol. Lepaskan!

00:17:23.792 --> 00:17:24.917
Bagaimana ini?

00:17:25.792 --> 00:17:27.833
- Lepas, Berengsek!
- Mengejutkan.

00:17:27.917 --> 00:17:29.708
- Apa yang terjadi?
- Gawat!

00:17:32.958 --> 00:17:34.708
<i>Pukulan Jin-seong sangat cepat.</i>

00:17:34.792 --> 00:17:36.250
<i>Aku bahkan tak bisa lihat!</i>

00:17:37.542 --> 00:17:38.500
<i>Aku melihatnya!</i>

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:42.042
<i>Aku sering dipukuli sejak kecil.</i>

00:17:42.208 --> 00:17:45.542
<i>Sekarang, aku bisa melihat tinju</i>
<i>melayang ke arahku.</i>

00:17:46.417 --> 00:17:48.875
<i>Masalahnya tubuhku terlalu lambat.</i>

00:17:49.958 --> 00:17:51.750
<i>Tapi sekarang…</i>

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:56.917
Dia menghindar!

00:17:58.125 --> 00:17:59.667
- Dia menghindar!
- Dia menghindar!

00:18:00.167 --> 00:18:01.167
Apa itu?

00:18:01.292 --> 00:18:02.750
- Dia menghindar!
- Hei, lihat!

00:18:05.417 --> 00:18:06.958
Baru kali ini ada yang menghindar!

00:18:11.125 --> 00:18:12.250
Dasar berengsek!

00:18:25.167 --> 00:18:26.125
Dia terpojok!

00:18:34.208 --> 00:18:36.083
<i>Aku akan kena pukul! Coba saja!</i>

00:18:39.417 --> 00:18:40.625
Apa yang terjadi?

00:18:41.292 --> 00:18:42.333
Kau menahannya?

00:18:45.792 --> 00:18:47.917
<i>Dia menahan tinjuku</i>
<i>hanya dengan melihatnya?</i>

00:18:48.042 --> 00:18:49.333
<i>Si berengsek ini…</i>

00:18:49.708 --> 00:18:51.250
<i>Dia bukan pemula.</i>

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:53.833
<i>Dia petarung jalanan!</i>

00:18:55.292 --> 00:18:56.250
<i>Aku harus apa?</i>

00:18:56.375 --> 00:18:58.917
<i>Situasinya makin sulit!</i>
<i>Dia akan memukuliku!</i>

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:01.875
Itu keren sekali!

00:19:04.042 --> 00:19:05.042
<i>Senyum!</i>

00:19:09.167 --> 00:19:12.333
<i>Aku yakin orang tua si babi juga gemuk.</i>

00:19:18.042 --> 00:19:19.083
<i>Lihat itu?</i>

00:19:19.167 --> 00:19:22.875
<i>Arahkan pukulan pertamamu ke solar plexus</i>
<i>untuk KO mutlak!</i>

00:19:23.042 --> 00:19:25.625
<i>Ini mudah bagi petarung sejati!</i>

00:19:43.792 --> 00:19:45.667
- Apa itu?
- Satu pukulan KO!

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:47.250
Lee Jin-seong dikalahkan!

00:19:48.083 --> 00:19:50.292
Dia hebat sekali!

00:19:50.375 --> 00:19:51.708
Ini sungguh terjadi?

00:19:54.375 --> 00:19:55.542
Luar biasa.

00:19:58.208 --> 00:20:01.792
<i>Astaga, memalukan!</i>
<i>Mi-jin melihat semuanya!</i>

00:20:06.375 --> 00:20:08.875
<i>Apa pukulanku sekuat itu?</i>

00:20:10.583 --> 00:20:12.500
KELAS VOKAL DAN TARI

00:20:12.625 --> 00:20:13.500
Lee Jin-seong?

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:20.125
Ya! Satu pukulan KO!
Semua membicarakannya!

00:20:21.333 --> 00:20:25.583
Jadi, dia lebih tampan dariku?
Anak baru itu?

00:20:28.292 --> 00:20:29.625
KELAS ARSITEKTUR

00:20:29.708 --> 00:20:30.708
Park Hyeong-seok?

00:20:34.958 --> 00:20:36.458
Dia tampan?

00:20:36.833 --> 00:20:38.500
Populer juga?

00:20:42.667 --> 00:20:44.167
Akan kuhancurkan dia!

00:20:48.042 --> 00:20:50.792
Park Hyeong-seok dari Kelas Desain Mode.

00:20:50.917 --> 00:20:55.208
Dia mengganggu Basco
dan Burn Knuckle juga.

00:20:56.125 --> 00:20:57.417
Dia baru pindah,

00:20:58.083 --> 00:21:00.750
dan aku kasihan padanya,
tapi habislah dia kini.

00:22:24.542 --> 00:22:26.542
Terjemahan subtitel oleh Teddy Firmansyah
